Bugs
1. Killer Ball mode:
a) Last ball in chain should not become killer
b) Accuracy ray should target to killer ball
3) Bomb power up should destroy killer ball if its nearby (with same animation, but without explosion audio)

2. Color Shift mode
Balls are only allowed to be shifted to allowed colors (for example, no white ball shift in 1.1 level)

3․ Sonic Speed mode
When chain accelaration ends, chain speed is normal for ~1s, and only then it becomes the specified speed multiplier

4. Moving Hole mode
If mode is enabled, then user goes to main menu and disables mode, then continues the game, hole continues to move
(and when user opens Modes menu, Moving hole is enabled)

5. Auto-Adnvance mode
After 13.1 level, 1.1 level starts automatically, and after clearing the level, 1.1 starts again, and forever
(correct behavior: the end credits should begin)